    "content": "<p>Happy holidays, Pilots! Thank you for playing War Robots: Frontiers this year&mdash;we are so grateful for all your feedback, playtime, and support. We hope you&rsquo;re looking forward to an amazing 2024!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out your achievements and highlights of 2023 in our <strong>Season&rsquo;s Greetings video</strong> below. Stick around &lsquo;til the end to receive an <strong>extra special gift!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XBIC-xOfyLo\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/XBIC-xOfyLo?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=JiIyH\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!&nbsp;</p>",
